{"id": "EUVD-2026-78657", "enisaUuid": "23a27bf7-e4c4-37ed-b13b-fd643d69af38", "description": "gitoxide gix-transport before 0.59.2 fails to filter control characters in git-daemon connect requests, allowing attackers to inject NUL/CR/LF bytes via crafted git URLs. Attackers can inject extra NUL-delimited protocol fields to spoof virtual hosts or inject newlines into daemon requests and logs.", "datePublished": "2026-09-15T15:18:28", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-21T19:22:09", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/GitoxideLabs/gitoxide/security/advisories/GHSA-rc7h-wp5f-w3g5", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gitoxide-gix-transport-before-0.59.2-cr-lf-nul-injection"], "aliases": ["GHSA-7849-h6h3-vww8", "CVE-2026-91986"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.23, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "296985c8-6724-370b-8c0a-ca11c4a9c824", "product": {"name": "gitoxide", "vendor": {"name": "GitoxideLabs"}}, "product_version": "0 <0.59.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "81ab01a8-922a-3780-b5fe-3d74fcfaa185", "vendor": {"name": "GitoxideLabs"}}], "isExploited": false}